tps://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-08-11T19:46:06Z","rename":{"from":"Black crashes when multiple `# fmt: skip`s are added in a multi-part if-clause.","to":"Black crashes when multiple `# fmt: skip` are added in a multi-part if-clause."},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/comments/3239540754","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/black/issues/4731#issuecomment-3239540754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/4731","id":3239540754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOB3dpmM7BF3gS","user":{"login":"ranjodhsingh1729","id":69916807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5OTE2ODA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69916807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729","html_url":"https://github.com/ranjodhsingh1729","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-30T21:05:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T21:05:02Z","body":"I've identified the root cause: when the second `# fmt: skip` is processed, its `prev_sibling` (the node that should be ignored) includes the `STANDALONE_COMMENT` generated by the first `# fmt: skip`. Since `STANDALONE_COMMENT` nodes do not include trailing newlines (these are added at a later stage), the formatter produces the following output:\n\n```python\nclass ClassWithALongName:\n    Constant1 = 1\n    Constant2 = 2\n    Constant3 = 3\n\n\ndef test():\n    if (\n        \"cond1\" == \"cond1\"\n        and \"cond2\" == \"cond2\"\n        and 1 in (\n            ClassWithALongName.Constant1,\n            ClassWithALongName.Constant2,\n            ClassWithALongName.Constant3, # fmt: skip        ) # fmt: skip    ):\n        return True\n    return False\n```\n\nA simple fix  would be to traverse the ignored nodes and insert trailing newlines for any STANDALONE_COMMENT nodes encountered:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/black/comments.py b/src/black/comments.py\nindex 8c88668..893a10b 100644\n--- a/src/black/comments.py\n+++ b/src/black/comments.py\n@@ -174,6 +174,15 @@ def normalize_fmt_off(\n         try_again = convert_one_fmt_off_pair(node, mode, lines)\n \n \n+def normalize_skipped_comment_newlines(node: Node):\n+    if node.type == STANDALONE_COMMENT:\n+        node.value += \"\\n\"\n+\n+    if not isinstance(node, Leaf):\n+        for child in node.children:\n+            normalize_skipped_comment_newlines(child)\n+\n+\n def convert_one_fmt_off_pair(\n     node: Node, mode: Mode, lines: Collection[tuple[int, int]]\n ) -> bool:\n@@ -209,6 +218,8 @@ def convert_one_fmt_off_pair(\n                 continue\n \n             first = ignored_nodes[0]  # Can be a container node with the `leaf`.\n+            normalize_skipped_comment_newlines(first)\n+\n             parent = first.parent\n             prefix = first.prefix\n             if comment.value in FMT_OFF:\n```\n\nI'll look for a better approach. If anyone has suggestions or ideas, I'd be glad to hear them.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/comments/3239540754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ranjodhsingh1729","id":69916807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5OTE2ODA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69916807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729","html_url":"https://github.com/ranjodhsingh1729","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranjodhsingh1729/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"dylwil3","id":53534755,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTM0NzU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53534755?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylwil3","html_url":"https://github.com/dylwil3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylwil3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylwil3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylwil3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https: